WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.260
Panels go wherever you want them. Drag one by its title bar, or double-click to fill the screen.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.894
Need some room? Minimize a panel to the tray, and click its chip to bring it right back.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:23.061
Select a panel and press Control I, to inspect it. Its provider, its status, and what it's been asked to do.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:29.197
And when things get busy, Arrange tiles everything neatly. You can save your favorite layouts from the toolbar.
